<title>USA: Deflecta-Shield Q4 net up on cost controls.</title>
<headline>Deflecta-Shield Q4 net up on cost controls.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANOLA, Iowa 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deflecta-Shield Corp said Wednesday reducing costs and waste helped boost earnings in the fourth quarter ended December 31.</p>
<p>Net income in the period totaled $1.0 million, or $0.21 a share, compared to a year-ago loss of $485,000, or $0.10 a share, the company said.</p>
<p>The company said sales climbed to $17.6 million from $15.5 million a year earlier.</p>
<p>Deflecta-Shield makes and distributes truck accessories.</p>
<p>Its shares closed up 1/8 Wednesday at 9-3/8.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
